BT /F1 11 Tf 72 608 Td (1. Heat the oven to 220 \260C and line a tray.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 592 Td (2. Whisk the flour, sugar, baking powder and salt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 576 Td (3. Stir in 300 ML heavy cream until a soft dough forms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 560 Td (4. Pat to 2 cm thick and cut 8 rounds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 544 Td (5. Place on the tray, spaced apart.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 528 Td (6. Brush the tops with 15 ML heavy cream.) Tj ET
